  "description": "Yu-Jin, the model student who dreamed of medical school, threw off her pace with a brief high school romance and blew her college entrance exams. While retaking them, her thug ex-boyfriend Jun-Ha reappears before her eyes. Is he trying to sabotage her exams again? Or is it genuine lingering affection?\n\nA sexy campus romance between two people so different they can't help but be drawn to each other.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
